+## Checking against your budget
+
+The `budget` command shows how much you spent in each category during a month
+alongside the limit you have configured for that category:
+
+```
+python -m tally.cli budget --month 2024-03
+```
+
+Categories where spending exceeds the configured budget are flagged so they stand
+out. Budgets are set in `tally/config.py` (or wherever your project keeps its
+configuration).
+
